Z||000004||mrfiero||02-12-2001||05:15 PM||||The swap meet isn't a car show, but you can still bring your Fiero.  There will be a ton of Fiero parts for sale at very low prices.  I was there last year and I will be there again this year.  I plan on bringing a TON of stuff, so I'd rather you all brought a truck instead of a Fiero.  (more room to haul stuff home)   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I believe the meet is the last weekend in April (27-29), but I'm not positive.<P><BR>See you all there!<BR>||||reg||1
