Z||000009||Bob Englert||02-13-2001||10:13 PM||||Hey ironhedno3:<P>I have a Grooms reman 2.5 that Ed put in my daughter's 87 coupe.  It has been running great.  We were able to take a 87 with 155K that was not far from the junkyard and give it a new lease on life.  She drives the car to school every day and knows she has a unique car that she intends to take care of.  Thanks for helping make it possible.  <P><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
Z||000010||Carrolles||02-14-2001||12:17 AM||||I got a Grooms 2.8 reman from Ed about a year ago.  I was travelling a lot so it took a couple of months to port the intake manifolds and the exhaust manifolds and repaint everything.  It runs great.  I just wish that when I bought mine Grooms offered the same unlimited mileage 18 month warranty on the 3.4L engine.  Oh well.  My wife's 85GT will need an engine before long so I just might get the 3.4 for my SE and put my 2.8 it the GT.<P>How about all of us from the Forum write our Screen names on our name tags at the Swap Meet so we'll finally get to meet everyone in person?<P>I've made both Swap Meets so far and had a blast and got some good deals.<P>See you there,<P>Carroll<p>[This message has been edited by Carrolles (edited 02-14-2001).]||||reg||1
